    "lines": [
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:0",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 1,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "나는 용궁 대청에서 용왕님을 모시는 자라였다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:1",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 2,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "그날 저녁, 조개등은 평소보다 일찍 켜졌다.\n며칠째 앓는 용왕님의 기침 소리가 넓은 대청에 울렸다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:2",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 3,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "용왕",
        "text": "자라야, 또 왔느냐.\n오늘은 네가 가져온 약도 제대로 마시지 못하겠구나.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:3",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 4,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "해초를 달인 물도 소용없었다.\n깊은 바다에서 구한 약초도 용왕님의 병을 낫게 하지 못했다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:4",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 5,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "용왕님 곁에 있던 의관이 오래된 처방책을 펼쳤다.\n한참 책장을 넘기던 손이 마침내 한 곳에서 멈췄다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:5",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 6,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "의관",
        "text": "전하, 남은 처방을 모두 확인했습니다.\n하지만 이제 한 가지 방법밖에는 남지 않았습니다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:6",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 7,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "용왕",
        "text": "말해 보아라.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:7",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 8,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "의관",
        "text": "육지에 사는 토끼의 간입니다.\n이 책에는 그것이 전하의 병을 고칠 마지막 약이라고 적혀 있습니다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:8",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 9,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "용왕",
        "text": "……살아 있는 토끼의 간을 말하는 것이냐?",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:9",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 10,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "의관",
        "text": "그렇습니다.\n오늘을 넘기면 그마저도 소용없을지 모릅니다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:10",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 11,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "대청 안이 조용해졌다.\n용왕님은 처방책을 바라보다가 천천히 눈을 감았다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:11",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 12,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "용왕",
        "text": "다른 약을 더 찾아보아라.\n남의 목숨을 빼앗아 내 목숨을 이으라는 처방을 어찌 따르겠느냐.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:12",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 13,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "의관",
        "text": "이미 할 수 있는 방법은 모두 써 보았습니다.\n지금은 선택할 시간이 거의 없습니다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:13",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 14,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "용왕님의 손끝이 가늘게 떨렸다.\n대청 밖에서는 신하들이 낮은 목소리로 술렁이고 있었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:14",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 15,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "용왕",
        "text": "자라야.\n네게 어려운 일을 하나 맡겨야겠다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:15",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 16,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "주인공",
        "text": "말씀하십시오.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:16",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 17,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "용왕",
        "text": "육지로 올라가 토끼를 찾아 데려오너라.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:17",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 18,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "주인공",
        "text": "……전하.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:18",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 19,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "용왕",
        "text": "토끼에게 내 병에 대해서는 말하지 마라.\n간이 필요하다는 사실은 더더욱 알려서는 안 된다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:19",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 20,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "용왕",
        "text": "그 사실을 알게 되는 순간 토끼는 틀림없이 달아날 것이다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:20",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 21,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "용왕",
        "text": "용궁의 잔치라고 해도 좋다.\n병든 이를 도와달라고 해도 좋다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:21",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 22,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "용왕",
        "text": "어떻게든 토끼를 이곳까지 데려오너라.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:22",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 23,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "나는 대답하지 못했다.\n무심코 목에 걸린 작은 패를 손으로 움켜쥐었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:23",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 24,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "차가운 패의 감촉이 오래전 기억을 불러냈다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:24",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 25,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "어린 시절, 나는 큰비에 휩쓸려 민물에서 바다까지 떠내려왔다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-young-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-child-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-flashback-rescue",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-young-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-child-unified-720x900"
            }
          ]
        },
        "audio": {
          "music": {
            "action": "play",
            "assetId": "audio:music:score-loss",
            "loop": true,
            "volume": 0.32,
            "fadeInMs": 700,
            "fadeOutMs": 500
          },
          "ambience": {
            "action": "play",
            "assetId": "audio:music:ambience-rain",
            "loop": true,
            "volume": 0.2,
            "fadeInMs": 700,
            "fadeOutMs": 500
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:25",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 26,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "짠물이 목으로 밀려들었다.\n숨조차 제대로 쉴 수 없었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-young-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-child-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-flashback-rescue",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-young-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-child-unified-720x900"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:26",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 27,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "등껍질을 웅크린 나를 발견한 사람이 젊은 용왕님이었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-young-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-child-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-flashback-rescue",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-young-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-child-unified-720x900"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:27",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 28,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "용왕",
        "text": "겁먹지 마라.\n이것을 목에 걸어 보아라.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-young-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-child-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-flashback-rescue",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-young-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-child-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:28",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 29,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "용왕님은 작은 패를 내 목에 걸어 주었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-young-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-child-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-flashback-rescue",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-young-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-child-unified-720x900"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:29",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 30,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "자신의 비늘로 만들었다는 '바다의 숨결'이었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-young-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-child-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-flashback-rescue",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-young-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-child-unified-720x900"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:30",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 31,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "신기하게도 숨이 다시 트였다.\n그때부터 나는 바닷속에서도 편히 숨을 쉴 수 있었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-young-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-child-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-flashback-rescue",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-young-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-child-unified-720x900"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:31",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 32,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "주인공",
        "text": "네……\n조금 살 것 같습니다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-young-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-child-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-flashback-rescue",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-young-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-child-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:32",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 33,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "용왕",
        "text": "그렇다면 천천히 말해 보아라.\n내 앞에서는 잘 보이려고 말을 꾸미지 않아도 된다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-young-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-child-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-flashback-rescue",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-young-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-child-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:33",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 34,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "용왕",
        "text": "네가 본 것을 있는 그대로 말해 주면 그것으로 충분하다.\n작은 목소리라도 내가 끝까지 듣겠다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-young-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-child-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-flashback-rescue",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-young-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-child-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:34",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 35,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "눈을 뜨자 다시 어두운 용궁 대청이었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ]
        },
        "audio": {
          "ambience": {
            "action": "stop",
            "fadeOutMs": 500
          },
          "music": {
            "action": "play",
            "assetId": "audio:music:score-tension",
            "loop": true,
            "volume": 0.32,
            "fadeInMs": 700,
            "fadeOutMs": 500
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:35",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 36,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "그리고 바로 그 용왕님이 이제 내게 토끼를 속여 오라고 명하고 있었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:36",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 37,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "주인공",
        "text": "전하께서는 제게 늘 사실대로 말하라고 하셨습니다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:37",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 38,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "주인공",
        "text": "그런데 이번에는 토끼에게 가장 중요한 사실을 숨겨야 합니까?",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:38",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 39,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "주인공",
        "text": "그 토끼는 자신이 왜 오는지도 모른 채 저를 따라올 것입니다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:39",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 40,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "용왕",
        "text": "……안다.\n그래서 다른 누구보다 네게 이 명령을 내리는 것이 괴롭구나.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:40",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 41,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "용왕",
        "text": "하지만 이제 내 목숨 하나만 걸린 일이 아니다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:41",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 42,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "용왕",
        "text": "내가 쓰러지면 용궁 전체가 큰 혼란에 빠질 것이다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:42",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 43,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "용왕",
        "text": "나 역시 이것이 옳다고 말할 수는 없다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:43",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 44,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "용왕",
        "text": "그래도 지금 내게 보이는 길은 이것뿐이다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:44",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 45,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "용왕님이 다시 거칠게 기침했다.\n나는 오래도록 대답하지 못했다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:45",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 46,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "자라의 생각",
        "text": "나를 살려 준 왕의 부탁을 저버릴 것인가.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:46",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 47,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "자라의 생각",
        "text": "아무것도 모르는 토끼를 속일 것인가.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:47",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 48,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "자라의 생각",
        "text": "어느 쪽도 가벼운 선택처럼 느껴지지 않았다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:48",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 49,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "나는 끝내 대답 대신 물문을 열었다.\n그리고 육지를 향해 헤엄쳤다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ]
        },
        "audio": {
          "music": {
            "action": "play",
            "assetId": "audio:music:score-ocean",
            "loop": true,
            "volume": 0.32,
            "fadeInMs": 700,
