        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:49",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 50,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "긴 물길을 지나 육지로 올라오자 차가운 겨울바람이 불었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-grassland",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ]
        },
        "audio": {
          "music": {
            "action": "play",
            "assetId": "audio:music:score-curiosity",
            "loop": true,
            "volume": 0.32,
            "fadeInMs": 700,
            "fadeOutMs": 500
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:50",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 51,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "갈대밭 너머에서 흰 토끼 한 마리가 마른 풀을 뜯고 있었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-grassland",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:51",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 52,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "토끼가 나를 발견했다.\n긴 귀 하나가 쫑긋 올라갔다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-grassland",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:52",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 53,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "토끼",
        "text": "바다에서 사는 자라 선생이 여기까지 웬일이시오?",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-grassland",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:53",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 54,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "토끼",
        "text": "설마 길을 잃은 건 아니겠지요?",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-grassland",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:54",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 55,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "나는 입을 열었다가 다시 다물었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-grassland",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:55",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 56,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "자라의 생각",
        "text": "용왕님의 명령을 모두 말할 수는 없다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-grassland",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:56",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 57,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "자라의 생각",
        "text": "그렇다면 무엇부터 말해야 할까?",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-grassland",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:start:57",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:start",
        "order": 58,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "토끼가 나를 물끄러미 바라보았다.\n나는 숨을 고르고 첫마디를 골랐다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-welcome",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "flow": {
          "type": "choice",
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "obey",
              "label": "용궁 잔치의 손님으로 초대한다고 말한다.",
              "targetLineId": "review-main-002:obey-route:0"
            },
            {
              "id": "hesitate",
              "label": "병든 이를 도와달라고 말한다.",
              "targetLineId": "review-main-002:hesitate-route:0"
            }
          ]
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:obey-route:0",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:obey-route",
        "order": 1,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "주인공",
        "text": "실은 용궁에 귀한 손님을 모시는 자리가 있소.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-grassland",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:obey-route:1",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:obey-route",
        "order": 2,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "주인공",
        "text": "육지에서 재치 있는 손님을 한 분 모셔 오라는 명을 받았소.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-grassland",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:obey-route:2",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:obey-route",
        "order": 3,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "주인공",
        "text": "그래서 선생을 찾아왔소.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-grassland",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:obey-route:3",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:obey-route",
        "order": 4,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "토끼",
        "text": "허허.\n용궁까지 내 재치가 소문났단 말이오?",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-grassland",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:obey-route:4",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:obey-route",
        "order": 5,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "토끼",
        "text": "내 귀가 길어서 소문도 잘 타는 모양이군.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-grassland",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:obey-route:5",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:obey-route",
        "order": 6,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "주인공",
        "text": "따뜻한 음식도 준비되어 있고 볼거리도 많소.\n함께 가보지 않겠소?",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-grassland",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:obey-route:6",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:obey-route",
        "order": 7,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "토끼",
        "text": "듣기에는 꽤 근사하구려.\n하지만 공짜 잔치만큼 수상한 것도 없다던데.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-grassland",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:obey-route:7",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:obey-route",
        "order": 8,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "토끼",
        "text": "정말 손님으로 부르는 것이 맞소?",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-grassland",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:obey-route:8",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:obey-route",
        "order": 9,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "토끼의 눈이 내 얼굴을 살폈다.\n나는 잠시 시선을 피했다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
