      {
        "id": "review-main-002:obey-route:9",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:obey-route",
        "order": 10,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "주인공",
        "text": "내가 용궁까지 안전하게 안내하겠소.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-grassland",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:obey-route:10",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:obey-route",
        "order": 11,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "주인공",
        "text": "이 '바다의 숨결'을 함께 지니면 물속에서도 숨을 쉴 수 있소.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-grassland",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:obey-route:11",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:obey-route",
        "order": 12,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "토끼",
        "text": "바닷속 구경까지 할 수 있다면 나쁠 것은 없겠군.\n좋소.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-grassland",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:obey-route:12",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:obey-route",
        "order": 13,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "토끼",
        "text": "대신 음식이 형편없으면 바로 돌아오겠소.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-grassland",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:obey-route:13",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:obey-route",
        "order": 14,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "지문",
        "text": "토끼는 농담하듯 웃으며 내 등에 올라탔다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
