      {
        "id": "review-main-002:hesitate-route:0",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:hesitate-route",
        "order": 1,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "주인공",
        "text": "용궁에 아주 위급하게 앓고 있는 분이 있소.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-grassland",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:hesitate-route:1",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:hesitate-route",
        "order": 2,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "주인공",
        "text": "육지의 지혜가 필요하다 하여 선생께 도움을 청하러 왔소.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-grassland",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:hesitate-route:2",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:hesitate-route",
        "order": 3,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "토끼",
        "text": "이상한 부탁이구려.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-grassland",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:hesitate-route:3",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:hesitate-route",
        "order": 4,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "토끼",
        "text": "병은 의원이 고치는 줄 알았는데 이제는 토끼도 병을 고치는 세상인가?",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-grassland",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:hesitate-route:4",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:hesitate-route",
        "order": 5,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "주인공",
        "text": "그분에게는 시간이 많지 않소.\n잠시 용궁까지 함께 가주면 좋겠소.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-grassland",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:hesitate-route:5",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:hesitate-route",
        "order": 6,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "토끼",
        "text": "잠깐.\n자라 선생 얼굴이 너무 어둡소.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-grassland",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:hesitate-route:6",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:hesitate-route",
        "order": 7,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "토끼",
        "text": "혹시 내게 말하지 않은 것이 있소?",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-grassland",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:hesitate-route:7",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:hesitate-route",
        "order": 8,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "나는 곧바로 대답하지 못했다.\n파도 소리만 한 번 밀려왔다가 빠져나갔다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-grassland",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ]
