      {
        "id": "review-main-002:palace:1",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
        "order": 2,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "하지만 안에는 잔치 음식도, 반갑게 맞는 신하들도 없었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:palace:2",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
        "order": 3,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "넓은 대청 한가운데 방석 하나만 덩그러니 놓여 있었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:palace:3",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
        "order": 4,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "토끼",
        "text": "이상하군.\n잔치라면 상부터 보여야 하고…",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:palace:4",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
        "order": 5,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "토끼",
        "text": "병자를 만나러 왔다면 병자부터 보여야 하는 것 아니오?",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:palace:5",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
        "order": 6,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "지문",
        "text": "어두운 기둥 뒤에서 무장한 호위들이 모습을 드러냈다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:palace:6",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
        "order": 7,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "지문",
        "text": "밧줄과 그물이 토끼를 둘러쌌다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ]
        },
        "audio": {
          "sounds": [
            {
              "id": "direction:review-main-002:palace:6:audio:sound:sfx-cloth",
              "assetId": "audio:sound:sfx-cloth",
              "volume": 0.5
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:palace:7",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
        "order": 8,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "토끼",
        "text": "……아하.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:palace:8",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
        "order": 9,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "토끼",
        "text": "이제야 자라 선생이 빼놓고 온 말이 무엇인지 알겠군.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:palace:9",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
        "order": 10,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "의관",
        "text": "전하!\n토끼가 도착했습니다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:palace:10",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
        "order": 11,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "의관",
        "text": "더 늦기 전에 처방을 시작해야 합니다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:palace:11",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
        "order": 12,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "의관",
        "text": "어서 토끼의 간을 꺼내야 합니다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:palace:12",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
        "order": 13,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "토끼",
        "text": "처방?\n무슨 처방 말이오?",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:palace:13",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
        "order": 14,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "의관",
        "text": "전하의 병에는 토끼의 간이 필요하다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:palace:14",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
        "order": 15,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "토끼의 얼굴에서 웃음기가 사라졌다.\n그는 천천히 나를 돌아보았다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:palace:15",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
        "order": 16,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "토끼",
        "text": "자라 선생.\n잔치 이야기를 했든…",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:palace:16",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
        "order": 17,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "토끼",
        "text": "병든 이를 도와달라고 했든…",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:palace:17",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
        "order": 18,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "토끼",
        "text": "가장 중요한 이야기는 한마디도 하지 않았구려.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:palace:18",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
        "order": 19,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "토끼",
        "text": "내가 죽을 수도 있다는 말 말이오.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:palace:19",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
        "order": 20,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "주인공",
        "text": "…….",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:palace:20",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
        "order": 21,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "용왕",
        "text": "토끼 선생.\n나 또한 그대를 이런 방법으로 데려오고 싶지는 않았소.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:palace:21",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
        "order": 22,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "토끼",
        "text": "그 말씀을 듣고 기뻐해야 할지 모르겠군요.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:palace:22",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
        "order": 23,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "용왕",
        "text": "하지만 내게 남은 시간이 거의 없소.\n……미안하오.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:palace:23",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
        "order": 24,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "지문",
        "text": "용왕님이 힘겹게 손을 들어 올렸다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:palace:24",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
        "order": 25,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "용왕",
        "text": "토끼를 붙잡아라.\n처방을 시작하라.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:palace:25",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
        "order": 26,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "호위들이 다가왔다.\n토끼의 귀가 천천히 아래로 처졌다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:palace:26",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
        "order": 27,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "그제야 나는 토끼가 정말 겁에 질렸다는 것을 알았다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:palace:27",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
        "order": 28,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "토끼",
        "text": "잠깐!\n모두 멈추시오!",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:palace:28",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
        "order": 29,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "토끼가 갑자기 목소리를 높였다.\n떨리던 눈빛도 어느새 달라져 있었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:palace:29",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
        "order": 30,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "토끼",
        "text": "이렇게 귀한 약을 찾으면서 그것이 어디 있는지도 모르셨습니까?",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:palace:30",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
        "order": 31,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "토끼",
        "text": "제 간은 지금 제 몸속에 없습니다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:palace:31",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
        "order": 32,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "용왕",
        "text": "뭐라고?",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:palace:32",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
        "order": 33,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "토끼",
        "text": "산짐승이라고 간을 늘 몸속에 넣고 다니는 줄 아셨습니까?",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:palace:33",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
        "order": 34,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "토끼",
        "text": "저는 멀리 다닐 때면 간을 꺼내 안전한 곳에 두곤 합니다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:palace:34",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
        "order": 35,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "토끼",
        "text": "오늘도 산 아래 바위 밑에 잎사귀로 싸 두고 왔습니다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:palace:35",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
        "order": 36,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "의관",
        "text": "그런 일이 있을 수 있습니까?",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.physician-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:palace:36",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
        "order": 37,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "토끼",
        "text": "그러니 직접 확인해 보십시오.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:palace:37",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
        "order": 38,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "토끼",
        "text": "지금 제 배를 갈랐다가 간이 없으면 어떻게 하시겠습니까?",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:palace:38",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
        "order": 39,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "토끼",
        "text": "전하의 마지막 기회만 사라지는 것 아닙니까?",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:palace:39",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
        "order": 40,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "말도 안 되는 이야기였다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:palace:40",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
        "order": 41,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "하지만 너무 태연하게 말하니 신하들이 서로 얼굴을 바라보았다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:palace:41",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
        "order": 42,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "용왕님도 선뜻 명령을 내리지 못했다.\n그러다 나를 바라보았다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:palace:42",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
        "order": 43,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "용왕",
        "text": "자라야.\n너는 평생 내 앞에서 사실을 숨긴 적이 거의 없었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:palace:43",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
        "order": 44,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "용왕",
        "text": "육지 가까운 곳에서 태어난 네가 우리보다 육지 생물을 더 잘 알겠지.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:palace:44",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
        "order": 45,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "용왕",
        "text": "저 토끼의 말을 어떻게 생각하느냐?",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:palace:45",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
        "order": 46,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "나는 토끼를 바라보았다.\n토끼도 말없이 나를 바라보고 있었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:palace:46",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
        "order": 47,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "자라의 생각",
        "text": "간을 몸 밖에 꺼내 두고 살아갈 수 없다는 것쯤은 나도 안다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:palace:47",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
        "order": 48,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "자라의 생각",
        "text": "사실대로 말한다면 용왕님을 살릴 수 있다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:palace:48",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
        "order": 49,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "자라의 생각",
        "text": "하지만 그 순간 토끼의 마지막 기회는 사라진다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:palace:49",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
        "order": 50,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "자라의 생각",
        "text": "반대로 모른 척한다면 토끼를 육지로 데려갈 틈을 만들 수 있다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:palace:50",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
        "order": 51,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "자라의 생각",
        "text": "대신 이번에는 내 선택으로 용왕님을 속이게 된다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:palace:51",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
        "order": 52,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "이번에는 누구의 명령도 아니었다.\n내가 직접 선택해야 했다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:palace:52",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:palace",
        "order": 53,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "용왕은 나의 대답을 기다리고 있다.\n이번 한마디는\n토끼의 생사와 용왕의 신뢰를 함께 가른다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
