      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:ending-1:0",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:ending-1",
        "order": 1,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "주인공",
        "text": "전하.\n토끼의 말은 사실이 아닙니다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:ending-1:1",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:ending-1",
        "order": 2,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "주인공",
        "text": "살아 있는 동물이 간을 몸 밖에 꺼내 두고 다닐 수는 없습니다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:ending-1:2",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:ending-1",
        "order": 3,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "대청 안이 조용해졌다.\n토끼는 잠시 눈을 감았다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:ending-1:3",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:ending-1",
        "order": 4,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "그리고 다시 나를 바라보았다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:ending-1:4",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:ending-1",
        "order": 5,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "토끼",
        "text": "그래요.\n이번에는 사실을 말했군요.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:ending-1:5",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:ending-1",
        "order": 6,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "토끼",
        "text": "그런데 자라 선생.\n처음 만났을 때도 그 사실들을 말해 주었다면…",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:ending-1:6",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:ending-1",
        "order": 7,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "토끼",
        "text": "나는 여기까지 오지 않았겠지요.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:ending-1:7",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:ending-1",
        "order": 8,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "나는 대답하지 못했다.\n호위들이 토끼를 데리고 대청 밖으로 향했다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:ending-1:8",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:ending-1",
        "order": 9,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "토끼는 더 이상 살려 달라고 외치지 않았다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:ending-1:9",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:ending-1",
        "order": 10,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "문이 닫히기 직전 긴 귀 끝만 잠시 보였다가 사라졌다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.rabbit-white-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ]
        },
        "audio": {
          "sounds": [
            {
              "id": "direction:review-main-002:ending-1:9:audio:sound:sfx-door",
              "assetId": "audio:sound:sfx-door",
              "volume": 0.5
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:ending-1:10",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:ending-1",
        "order": 11,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "며칠 뒤 용왕님은 자리를 털고 일어났다.\n\n용궁에는 다시 밝은 조개등이 켜졌다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-recovered-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-recovered-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:ending-1:11",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:ending-1",
        "order": 12,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "신하들은 나라를 살린 공을 세웠다며 나를 칭찬했다.\n\n용왕님도 내 목에 황금 훈장을 걸어 주었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-recovered-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-recovered-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:ending-1:12",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:ending-1",
        "order": 13,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "목에는 오래전 받은 '바다의 숨결'과 새로 받은 훈장이 나란히 걸려 있었다.\n\n하지만 대청 한쪽에는 토끼가 앉았던 빈 방석이 남아 있었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-recovered-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-recovered-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:ending-1:13",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:ending-1",
        "order": 14,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "나는 용왕 앞에서 거짓말을 하지 않았다.\n\n그렇다고 처음부터 토끼에게 사실을 숨겼던 일이 없어지는 것은 아니었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-recovered-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-recovered-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:ending-1:14",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:ending-1",
        "order": 15,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "왕은 살아났다.\n\n용궁도 평화를 되찾았다.\n\n그 모든 것을 바라보면서도 나는 가끔 빈 방석 앞에서 발걸음을 멈췄다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-recovered-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-recovered-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:ending-1:15",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:ending-1",
        "order": 16,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "「진실을 말한 자라」\n\n[생각해 보기]\n용왕에게 사실을 말한 자라는 무엇을 지켰을까?\n그리고 그 선택으로 무엇을 잃었을까?",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-recovered-unified-720x900",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "flow": {
          "type": "goto",
          "targetLineId": null
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-recovered-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:shield-route:0",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:shield-route",
        "order": 1,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "주인공",
        "text": "전하.\n저도 토끼의 말을 그대로 믿기는 어렵습니다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:shield-route:1",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:shield-route",
        "order": 2,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "주인공",
        "text": "하지만 지금 여기서 토끼를 죽였다가 정말 간이 없다면…",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:shield-route:2",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:shield-route",
        "order": 3,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "주인공",
        "text": "다시는 기회가 없습니다.",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-main-002:shield-route:3",
        "chapterId": "review-main-002:shield-route",
        "order": 4,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "용왕",
        "text": "그래서 어떻게 하겠다는 것이냐?",
        "leftAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached",
        "rightAssetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900",
        "backgroundId": "rabbit-turtle.background.rabbit-turtle-bg-palace-trap",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.dragonking-sick-elder-attached"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "rabbit-turtle.character.turtle-unified-720x900"
            }
          ],
